    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University's Arusha Climate and Environmental Research Centre (AKU-ACER) recently played host to a transformative learning experience for over 18 Aga Khan Education Services (AKES) students and their dedicated teachers. From January 10 to January 14, 2024, the vibrant campus became a hub of exploration, community engagement, and hands-on environmental education.",
